Package: toonlite
Title: Read, Write, Validate, Stream, and Convert 'TOON' Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Alejandro Jiménez Rico", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "aljrico@gmail.com")
Description: Reads, writes, validates, streams and converts 'TOON'
    (Token-Oriented Object Notation) data, a text format for passing
    structured data to language models. Implements version 4.4 of the
    specification <https://github.com/toon-format/spec>. C++ backend with no
    required dependencies. Converts to and from CSV, and, with 'jsonlite' or
    'arrow' installed, JSON, Parquet and Feather.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/aljrico/toonlite
BugReports: https://github.com/aljrico/toonlite/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
SystemRequirements: C++17
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    jsonlite,
    arrow
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: yes
